# Deliberately NOT using the stock toptal C/C++ section here. Its `*.d`
# prerequisite pattern also matches *directories* named `*.d`, which is how the
# sibling rootfs repository silently failed to commit overlay/etc/init.d for
# weeks. Everything this build generates already lives under build/ or
# downloads/, so the object-file patterns bought nothing and cost that.
